  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Breath Weapon",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "cold"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The ice mephit breathes shards of ice in a 15 foot cone that deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> cold damage and <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> piercing damage to each creature within the area (DC 17 basic Reflex save).</p>\n<p>The ice mephit can't use Breath Weapon again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [
    {
      "name": "Arcane Innate Spells",
      "type": "innate",
      "bonus": 9,
      "dc": 17,
      "focusPoints": {
        "current": 0,
        "max": 0
      },
      "autoHeightenLevel": 1,
      "cantrips": [
        {
          "name": "Chill Touch",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "void"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 living or undead creature",
          "save": "basic fortitude",
          "description": "<p>Siphoning void energy into yourself, your hand radiates a pale darkness. Your touch weakens the living and disorients undead, possibly even causing them to flee. The effect depends on whether the target is living or undead.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Living Creature</strong> The spell deals void damage equal to <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> plus your spellcasting modifier. The target attempts a basic Fortitude save, but is also Enfeebled 1 for 1 round on a critical failure.</li>\n<li><strong>Undead Creature</strong> The target is Off-Guard for 1 round on a failed Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target is also Fleeing for 1 round unless it succeeds at a Will save.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The void damage to living creatures increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "tMLJwrzc7C9mSGWk"
        },
        {
          "name": "Ray of Frost",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "cold",
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "120 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You blast an icy ray. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> cold damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and takes a -10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes normal damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "roG1L564EjXTDyGw"
        }
